       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DAY03-01.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CAPITAL PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 9999.99 TO WS-CAPITAL
           IF WS-CAPITAL >= 10000
               DISPLAY "CATEGORIE PREMIUM"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "CATEGORIE STANDARD"
           END-IF
           STOP RUN.
